================================================================================

Anvil is licensed Apache-2.0. Do NOT read that as freedom to operate. The
Apache-2.0 Section 3 patent grant runs from CONTRIBUTORS over their OWN
contributions and does nothing about third-party patents. US10043004B2
(SAST-DAST correlation, priority 2015-01-30, granted 2018-08-07, expires
approximately 2035, assignee Denim Group Ltd. / Coalfire Systems) is materially
